00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:10.950
EMILIO DEL TESSANDORO: I'm going
to go through some history, how

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:13.350
storage in Spotify looked
like in the past years.

00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:15.570
Then Sandhya is going to
continue with some details

00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:17.820
about Cloud Bigtable.

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:20.830
Then I'm going to go through
the migration process

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:23.400
that we are doing at
Spotify, and then I'm

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:28.380
